:: End4 [ending prose] {"position":"1000,2150","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.left: " "
config.footer.center: "[[Restart|Start]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  [[Credits->End.Credits]]"
--
The score is calculated from the values for circularity, happiness and your left over budget. 

Score = 2.5 * <img src="images/circularity.webp" class="indicator-icon"> + 1.5 * <img src="images/good.webp" class="indicator-icon indicator-icon-offset-3"> + 1 * <img src="images/money.webp" class="indicator-icon">

With the values from your current game, you reached:<br>
Score = 2.5 * {circle} + 1.5 * {happy} + 1 * {money} = {final}

<div class="passage-navigation">
<br>
[[Continue->End5]]
</div>


:: End5 [ending prose] {"position":"1000,2275","size":"100,100"}
The game contains many decision points where you choose between different options: Six rounds of <span class="policy">policy</span> decisions, up to three rounds of <span class="tech">technology</span> decisions, and up to three <span class="event">events</span> are possible.

Each sequence of decisions creates a unique path through the game, resulting in a large number of possible playthroughs.

<div class="passage-navigation">
Can you guess the magnitude of that number?
<br><br>
[[Continue->End6]]
</div>


:: End6 [ending] {"position":"1000,2400","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.right: " "
config.footer.left: "Your score: {final}"
--

There are close to <b>4 million (3.824.020)</b> different playthroughs.<br> 
Find out how many there are to reach your score:<br><br>


<img src="images/graph.webp" style="height:250px;">



:: Event1.1 [event] {"position":"1175,425","size":"100,100"}



An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>FIRE AT E-WASTE SORTING PLANT</b>

One of the largest recycling plants in Phonopolis is about to burn down.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Put out the fire.->1.1OutFire]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Do nothing.->1.1Fire]]</span>



:: Event1.2 [event] {"position":"1500,425","size":"100,100"}



An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>GLOBAL REPAIR PARTS MARKET COLLAPSE</b>

A major supplier of generic spare parts in Phonopolis is about to go bankrupt.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Do nothing.->1.2bankrupt]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Provide financial support.->1.2save]]</span>



:: Event1.3 [event] {"position":"1775,425","size":"100,100"}



An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>MINIMALIST TECH MOVEMENT</b>

A global minimalism trend encourages people in Phonopolis to own fewer devices.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Encourage consumer spending.->1.3spending]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Promote the minimalism trend.->1.3minimalism]]</span>



:: Event2.1 [event] {"position":"1250,925","size":"100,100"}



An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>NEW PINEAPPLE PHONE</b>

New cell phone model with popular features is about to be launched in Phonopolis.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Do nothing.->2.1Support]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Promote longer phone use.->2.1Reduce]]</span>



:: Event2.2 [event] {"position":"1525,925","size":"100,100"}

An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>PRICE DROP</b>

A technological breakthrough makes new phones extremely cheap in Phonopolis.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Do nothing.->2.2cheap]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Protect repair and reuse.->2.2protect]]</span>



:: Event2.3 [event] {"position":"1825,925","size":"100,100"}



An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>GLOBAL CHIP CRISIS</b>

Cell phone production decreases in Phonopolis. New cell phones will get much more expensive.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Support repair and reuse.->2.3RR]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Subsidize new phone purchases.->2.3subsidize]]</span>



:: Event3.1 [event] {"position":"1250,1200","size":"100,100"}


An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>TOXIC WASTE</b>

New materials cause toxic waste during recycling.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Continue recycling as usual.->3.1toxic]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Introduce stricter regulations.->3.1regulate]]</span>



:: Event3.2 [event] {"position":"1525,1200","size":"100,100"}


An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>FEAR OF DATA THEFT</b>

A viral news story in Phonopolis makes people afraid to give away or recycle old devices.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Do nothing.->3.2nothing]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Launch a public information campaign.->3.2info]]</span>



:: Event3.3 [event] {"position":"1825,1200","size":"100,100"}


An <span class="event">EVENT</span> happens:<br>
<b>GLOBAL RECESSION</b>

People in Phonopolis have less disposable income.

Your Choice: 

<span class="event">[[Support circular solutions.->3.3circular]]</span>

<span class="event">[[Offer consumer purchase support.->3.3purchase]]</span>



