:: Start2 [intro prose] {"position":"925,50","size":"100,100"}
Your goal is to build a circular smartphone economy while balancing citizen happiness and the city budget.

You can decide about <span class="policy">laws and policies</span>, invest in research for <span class="tech">new technologies</span> or may have to deal with <span class="event">events</span>. 

